        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide interactive bill presentment and analytics, and Information Technology as a Service Solutions (ITaaS).",
        "start_character": 195,
        "end_character": 313
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002749",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002749-ef793fffbb5bab18",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002749",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide our customers with carrier services, which consists of phone, data and satellite and related mobile services for a connected device or end point.",
        "start_character": 4776,
        "end_character": 4937
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002749",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002749-ef793fffbb5bab18",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002749",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide “migration to the cloud” services that enables our customers to take advantage of cost savings through economies of scale and elimination of redundancy as well as taking advantage of built in scalability and resiliency of the cloud.",
        "start_character": 4504,
        "end_character": 4752
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002749",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002749-ef793fffbb5bab18",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002749",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We approach selling our services under either a direct sales model under which we control the contract and key relationships or we partner with a large systems integrator and other strategic partners to provide our TMaaS solution as part of their overall total solution offering to the end customer.",
        "start_character": 7430,
        "end_character": 7729
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002749",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002749-ef793fffbb5bab18",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002749",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are a leading provider of Technology Management as a Service (TMaaS) that consists of federally certified communications management, and identity management.",
        "start_character": 34,
        "end_character": 194
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002749",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002749-ef793fffbb5bab18",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002749",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that we are presently the only provider of all four of these critical services offerings.",
        "start_character": 20587,
        "end_character": 20687
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001654954-26-002749",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001654954-26-002749-ef793fffbb5bab18",
        "accession_number": "0001654954-26-002749",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do not view our services as a commodity, and comparability of our TMaaS offering against other competitors’ service offerings is not practical due to differences in pricing models described above and overall capabilities among competitors.",
